From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 03:00:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] UML-ANDROID-LOCAL: Mesa Venus generated Soong port

Generated by AOSP's meson2hermetic converter from this tree's own meson build,
then scoped: every module name gains a venus_ prefix because AOSP already
carries a second Mesa port at external/mesa3d whose module names are otherwise
identical, and Soong module names are global at the Make layer. The Vulkan HAL
module keeps its vulkan.virtio name because that name is the installed HAL
file name the Android loader resolves through ro.hardware.vulkan.

Submit changes through the generator, not by editing these files.
